{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38299","headline":"无题 二 · 韩偓","name":"无题 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧瓦偏光日，红帘不受尘。\n柳昏连绿野，花烂烁清晨。\n书密偷看数，情通破体新。\n明言终未实，暗祝始应真。\n枉道嫌偷药，推诚鄙效颦。\n合成云五色，宜作日中轮。\n照兽金涂爪，钗鱼玉镂鳞。\n渺弥三岛浪，平远一楼春。\n堕髻还名寿，修蛾本姓秦。\n櫂寻闻犬洞，槎入饮牛津。\n麟脯随重酿，霜华间八珍。\n锦囊霞彩烂，罗韤砑光匀。\n羞涩佯牵伴，娇饶欲泥人。\n偷儿难捉搦，慎莫共比邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}